<!-- content tabs sec start -->
<section class="content-tabs-sec section-padding">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-lg-12">
                <div class="panels">
                    <section id="tab1" class="panel active fade-in" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t1">
                        <h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric Nephrology</h3>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric Nephrology Department, we specialise in the diagnosis, treatment and long-term management of kidney and urinary tract disorders in children&mdash;from infancy through adolescence. With a team committed to clinical excellence and child-centred care, we combine advanced diagnostic technology with compassionate expertise to ensure every young patient receives the highest standard of renal care.</p>
                        <p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
                        
                        <div class="workup-sec mt-3">
                            <h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Renal Function Assessment</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Comprehensive evaluation of kidney health through blood tests, urine analysis and biochemical profiling to detect early signs of renal impairment, electrolyte imbalance, or metabolic dysfunction.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Ultrasound and Doppler Imaging</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Non-invasive imaging to assess kidney structure, detect congenital abnormalities, reflux, obstruction, scarring, or vascular issues affecting renal function.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Ambulatory Blood Pressure Monitoring (ABPM)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Twenty-four-hour monitoring to detect masked hypertension, white-coat hypertension and early signs of renal-related high blood pressure.</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Renal Biopsy</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Ultrasound-guided renal biopsy for precise diagnosis of glomerular diseases, nephrotic syndrome variants, vasculitis and other inflammatory renal conditions, enabling tailored treatment plans.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Management of Acute Kidney Injury (AKI)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Rapid identification and treatment of AKI through fluid optimisation, medication adjustments and intensive monitoring to prevent long-term kidney damage.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no">
                                    <img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricNephrology.png" alt="Paediatric Nephrology" />
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD) Care</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Comprehensive, stage-based management including dietary counselling, growth monitoring, anaemia management, bone and mineral disorder treatment and preparation for renal replacement therapy when required.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Dialysis Services</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p><strong>Peritoneal Dialysis (PD):</strong> Child-friendly home-based therapy for chronic kidney failure, with training and ongoing support for families.</p>
                                    <p><strong>Haemodialysis (HD):</strong> Paediatric-specific dialysis protocols ensuring safety, comfort and optimal clearance.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Renal Transplant Evaluation &amp; Post-Transplant Care</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Assessment of suitability for kidney transplantation, coordination with transplant teams, immunosuppression management, infection prevention and long-term graft monitoring.</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Nephrotic and Nephritic Syndromes</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Expert diagnosis and management of steroid-sensitive, steroid-resistant and congenital nephrotic syndrome, along with glomerulonephritis, IgA nephropathy, lupus nephritis and other complex renal pathologies.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Urinary Tract Infections (UTI)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Comprehensive evaluation and treatment of recurrent UTIs, including imaging, antibiotic prophylaxis when indicated and management of underlying anatomical or functional causes.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Tubulopathies and Electrolyte Disorders</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Diagnosis and long-term management of conditions such as renal tubular acidosis, Bartter syndrome, Gitelman syndrome and other disorders affecting salt balance, acid&ndash;base status and growth.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Hypertension Clinic</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Focused care for all forms of childhood hypertension, especially secondary hypertension arising from renal pathology. Includes medication optimisation, lifestyle planning and target organ monitoring.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Congenital Renal and Urinary Tract Disorders (CAKUT)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Holistic management of antenatal hydronephrosis, duplex kidneys, posterior urethral valves, bladder dysfunction and other structural abnormalities.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Enuresis and Bladder Dysfunction</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Diagnosis and management of day and night-time wetting, bladder instability, dysfunctional voiding and bowel&ndash;bladder dysfunction through behavioural therapy, medication and urotherapy.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Kidney Stones and Metabolic Stone Disease</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Evaluation and treatment of paediatric nephrolithiasis, including metabolic work-up, dietary guidance, medication and long-term prevention strategies.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Rare and Genetic Kidney Diseases</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Care for hereditary renal disorders such as Alport syndrome, polycystic kidney disease, cystinosis and complement-mediated diseases, supported by access to specialised genetic testing.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animated">Renal Rehabilitation and Long-Term Follow-Up</h4>
                            <p class="fadeInUp animated">We offer structured follow-up programmes focusing on growth, nutrition, psychological support, school integration and transition to adult renal services. Our multidisciplinary team ensures continuity of care and improved quality of life for children living with chronic renal conditions.</p>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
